lineup Small text

box bidA as Bid A [note: 0 ETH]
box bidB as Bid B [note: 0 ETH]

item one, two, three

step Line up
  say note adds a value chip under the lane name.
  line bidA: one, two
  line bidB: three, one

step Rewrite
  say A note line inside a step rewrites that text from that step on.
  note bidA: 0.05 ETH
  note bidB: 0.12 ETH
